with pilot guardrail, error taxonomy, source evidence, canonicalization, promotion-gate, and evidence-gap fields.\n\n## Artifact paths\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit-regression-fixtures.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-candidate-generator-harness.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-candidate-generator-packets.examples.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-candidate-generator-harness.validator-result.json`\n\n## Exact counts\n- Pilot candidates audited: 3\n- Pilot high-severity errors observed: 0\n- Regression fixtures added: 10\n- Required high-severity error classes covered: 10\n- Candidate harness packets: 3\n- Raw candidate count: 3\n- Accepted/promoted edges: 0\n- External model calls: 0\n- Full 3530 generation performed: false\n\n## Go/no-go\nNo-go for full-scale candidate generation in #1324 without new guardrails/authorization.\n\nBlocked reasons:\n- no fresh external model authorization for full-scale generation\n- pilot source count is 3, below the 100-200 calibration target\n- only no-auth fixture-backed raw candidates were audited\n\n## Verification\n- `git fetch origin main` passed.\n- `git worktree add -b feat/issue-1323 /home/samsen/.worktrees/ciecopilot-home/sem-kg-hvy-09-audit origin/main` failed because the branch already existed; safe fallback used clean existing `feat/issue-1323` branch at the exact requested worktree path.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed with warnings only for branch naming/ahead state; worktree clean.\n- `gh issue view 1323 --json body,title,state,url` passed.\n- `gh issue view 1313 --json body,title,state,url` passed.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-candidate-generator-harness.mjs` passed: validation_status pass, packet_count 3, raw_candidate_count 3, accepted_edge_count 0, external_model_call_count 0.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit.mjs` passed: validation_status pass, pilot_candidate_count 3, pilot_high_severity_error_count 0, regression_fixture_count 10, go_no_go no_go_for_full_scale_generation.\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-candidate-generator-harness.test.js` passed: 2 suites, 8 tests.\n- `npm run lint:changed -- --base 2b73b412dfdb62eec3cc2e5c297c5c24470b9ffc --json` failed due local tooling: `spawnSync eslint ENOENT`.\n\n## Boundaries preserved\n- No full 3530 semantic candidate generation.\n- No large accepted graph promotion.\n- No external LLM/VLM/API calls.\n- No Supabase mutation.\n- No frontend UI.\n- No production RAG reindex.\n- High-risk prerequisite/misconception/mastery-style edges remain review-first and are not auto-accepted.","created_at":"2026-07-05T23:45:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T00:10:31Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T00:10:31Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T00:10:31Z","merge_commit_sha":"b068d32292562bc5b4b1d8133218e86219f76915","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1350/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1350/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1350/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/392691022c217785611fd3e3de74ccce99edd58b","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1323","ref":"feat/issue-1323","sha":"39